$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: General Procedure for Suzuki coupling
reaction:
3-'Benzo[1,3]dioxol-5-yl-2-(5-bromo-furan-2-carbonyl)-1,2,3,4-tetrahydro-pyrrolo[3,4-b]quinolin-9-one
(12a) (0.100 g, 0.2086 mmol), boronic acid (0.2296 mmol, 1.1 eq),
Pd(PPh3)4 (12.4mg, 0.01043 mmol) and K2CO3 (86.4 mg, 0.6258 mmol) in
1,4-dioxane (8 mL) and H2O (2 mL) was degased under N2 and then stirred
at 100°C for 1.5 h. Purification by preparative TLC (5% CH3OH/CH2Cl2)
provided product as a solid.
4-[5-(3-Benzo[1,3]dioxol-5-yl-9-oxo-1,3,4,9-tetrahydro-pyrrolo[3,4-b]quinoline-2-carbonyl)-furan-2-yl]-benzoic
acid (20h). Yield 79%; 1H NMR (CD3OD) δ 5.32 (d, 2H, J= 12.5 Hz ), 5.51
(d, 2H, J = 12.5 Hz), 5.91 (s, 2H), 6.40 (s, 1H), 6.74 ~ 8.45 (m, 11 H);
MS (m/z): 521 (MH+), 519 (MH-); HRMS calc'd. MH+' for C30H20N2O7 is
521.1349; found 521.1362.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM Suzuki coupling reaction
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
