$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Compound 46 (330 mg, 0.34 mmol, 1.0 equiv) was dissolved in a mixture of
THF/MeOH/H2O = 3/1/1 (5 mL), and LiOH.H2O (43 mg, 1.0 mmol, 3.0 equiv)
was added at 0 °C. The mixture was stirred for 5 hours then acidified
with 1N aq. HCl to pH = 2 and extracted with Ethyl Acetate. The combined
organic layers were washed with water and brine, dried over anhydrous
Na2SO4 and concentrated in vacuo. The residue was dissolved in 4 M HCl in
dioxane (6 mL) at room temperature. The mixture was stirred for 3 hours
and the solvent was removed. The resulting residue was dissolved in DMF
(300 mL), and FDPP (260 mg, 0.68 mmol, 2.0 equiv), DIPEA (182 μL, 1.0
mmol, 3.0 equiv) were added at room temperature. The resulting mixture
was stirred for 2 days before the solvent was removed under reduced
pressure. The residue was dissolved in Ethyl Acetate and washed with 1 N
aq. HCl, Sat. NaHCO3 and brine. After removal of the solvent, the reside
was dissolved in MeOH (2 mL) and Pd(OH)2/C (20 mg) was added. The mixture
was stirred at room temperature under H2 (balloon) overnight then
filtered through a pad of celite. The filtrate was concentrated and the
resulting residue was dissolved in DCM (2 mL) and pyroglutamic acid (44
mg, 0.34 mmol, 1.0 equiv), EDCI (65 mg, 0.34 mmol, 1.0 equiv), HOBt.H2O
(46 mg, 0.34 mmol, 1.0 equiv), DIPEA (61 μL, 0.34 mmol, 1.0 equiv) were
added at room temperature. After 12 hours, the mixture was washed with
water and brine, dried over anhydrous Na2SO4, and concentrated in vacuo.
The residue was purified by silica gel flash chromatography (Methanol in
DCM 2% to 10%). Compound 1 in ~6% yield. (Rf = 0.1, 5% Methanol in DCM).
1H NMR (DMSO-d6, 600 MHz) δ 10.57 (s, 1H), 8.80 (t, J = 5.6 Hz, 1H), 8.59
(d, J = 5.3 Hz, 1H), 7.97 (s, 1H), 7.67 (dd, J = 8.5 Hz, 1H), 7.37 (s,
1H), 7.36 (d, J = 8.3 Hz, 1H), 7.24-7.17 (m, 4H), 7.12 (m, 1H), 7.08 (d,
J = 8.2 Hz, 1H), 6.72 (d, J = 8.3 Hz, 1H), 4.56 (m, 1H), 4.37 (dd, J =
8.7, 4.6 Hz, 1H), 4.24 (d, J = 7.2 Hz, 1H), 4.06 (m, 1H), 3.93 (d, J =
15.1, 6.5 Hz, 1H), 3.77 (dd, J = 15.1, 3.6 Hz, 1H), 3.59 (m, 1H), 3.28
(m, 2H), 3.08 (dd, J = 12.8, 4.4 Hz, 1H), 2.91 (dd, J = 13.4, 8.6 Hz,
1H), 2.79 (dd, J = 12.4, 5.8 Hz, 1H), 2.4 (m, 1H), 2.34-2.24 (m, 3H),
2.19-2.15 (m, 1H), 2.11-2.05 (m, 1H), 1.95 (m, 1H), 1.89-1.86 (m, 1H),
1.63-1.60 (m, 1H), 1.47-1.36 (m, 4H), 1.29 (m, 1H), 1.19-1.14 (m, 1H),
0.96 (t, J = 7.4 Hz, 3H), 0.79 (d, J = 6.7 Hz, 3H), 0.69 (d, J = 6.5 Hz,
3H); 13C NMR (DMSO-d6, 150 MHz) δ196.22, 177.61, 174.81, 171.69, 170.57,
169.88, 168.81, 159.70, 137.27, 132.31, 129.18, 129.07, 128.06, 126.64,
124.79, 113.51, 59.61, 54.43, 53.74, 53.06, 47.34, 45.60, 40.95, 37.57,
36.86, 32.93, 30.55, 29.24, 25.34, 24.19, 22.92, 21.97, 21.20, 20.75,
12.28; HRMS Calcd for C69H51N6O8 [M+H+]: 731.3763; Found: 731.3766.
