$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM (3S,7R,8aR)-2-{(2S)-2-(4,4-Difluorocyclohexyl)-2-[(N-methyl-L-alanyl)amino]acetyl}-N-[(4R)-3,4-dihydro-2H-chromen-4-yl]-7-hydroxyoctahydropyrrolo[1,2-a]pyrazine-3-carboxamide
dihydrochloride (44). To a solution of 41 (500 mg) in 4 M HCl in methanol
(10 mL) was added 20% Pd(OH)2/C (100 mg), and the reaction mixture was
stirred at room temperature for 18 h under hydrogen atmosphere. The
mixture was filtered through a pad of Celite, and the filtrate was
concentrated under reduced pressure to give
(3S,7,8aR)-2-[(2S)-2-amino-2-(4,4-difluorocyclohexyl)acetyl]-N-[(4R)-3,4-dihydro-2H-chromen-4-yl]-7-hydroxyoctahydropyrrolo[1,2-a]pyrazine-3-carboxamide
as a colorless oil (383 mg). To a solution of the obtained colorless oil
(383 mg), N-(tertbutoxycarbonyl)-N-methyl-L-alanine 30 (190 mg, 0.935
mmol), HOBt (116 mg, 0.858 mmol) and DIPEA (0.272 mL, 1.562 mmol) in DMF
(5 mL) was added EDC (0.413 mL, 0.212 mmol), and the reaction mixture was
stirred at room temperature for 3 h, and partitioned between EtOAc (100
mL) and water (25 mL). The organic layer was washed with brine (25 mL),
dried over MgSO4, and concentrated under reduced pressure. The residue
was purified by silica gel column chromatography (5-100% EtOAc in
n-hexane) to give tert-butyl
[(1S)-2-({(1S)-1-(4,4-difluorocyclohexyl)-2-[(3S,7R,8aR)-3-(4R)-3,4-dihydro-2H-chromen-4-yl-carbamoyl]-7-hydroxyhexahydropyrrolo-[1,2-a]pyrazin-2(1H)-yl]-2-oxoethyl}amino)-1-methyl-2-oxoethyl]-methylcarbamate
as a white amorphous solid (144 mg). The obtained colorless amorphous
solid (130 mg, 0.192 mmol) was dissolved in 4 M HCl in cyclopentyl methyl
ether (5 mL), and the solution was stirred at room temperature for 2 h.
The solution was concentrated under reduced pressure, and the residue was
washed with ethyl ether (20 mL) and dried under reduced pressure to give
44 as a white amorphous powder, yield 93 mg, 20%. 1H NMR (DMSO-d6, 300
MHz): δ 1.23-1.53 (5H, m), 1.54-2.38 (10H, m), 2.41-2.49 (3H, m),
3.02-4.30 (10H, m), 4.32-4.77 (3H, m), 4.78-5.11 (2H, m), 5.78 (1H, br
s), 6.65-6.98 (2H, m), 7.04-7.58 (2H, m), 8.28-9.69 (4H, m), 11.71-12.92
(1H, m); Anal. Calcd for C29H43Cl2F2N5O5•2.5H2O: C, 50.07; H, 6.96 N,
10.07. Found: C, 49.95; H, 7.30; N, 9.73.
